ALI KI BETI HOON AMMA FALAK SATAYI HOON,<br>
 BAHEN HUSSAIN KI HOON AAP KI MAIN JAYI HOON<br>
<br>
LAHAD PA MAA KI YE KEHTI THI ZAINAB-E-MUZTAR,<br>
 SUNAUON KAISE MERE SAR SE CHIN GAYI CHADAR,<br>
 TERE HUSSAIN KE HULQOOM PAR CHALA KHANJAR,<br>
 LAHOO BHARA HUA KURTA MAIN LEKE AAYI HOON<br>
<br>
SHAHEED HOGAYA BHAI CHINI RIDA SAR SE,<br>
 JO AAYI SHAAME GHARIBAAN TOH JAL GAYE KHAIME,<br>
 HAMARI GODH KE PAALE THE DASHT MAIN BIKHRE,<br>
 MAIN EK DIN MAIN BAHATTAR KE GHAM UTHAYI HOON<br>
<br>
NABI KI AAL KE KHAIMO MAIN THA AJAB MEHSHAR,<br>
 THI SARI BIBIYA ZERE SAMAA BA REHNA SAR,<br>
HAR EKQADAM PAQAYAMAT GUZAR GAYI HUM PAR,<br>
 BACCHA KE SHOLON SE ABID KO LEKE AAYI HOON<br>
<br>
SHAHEED HOGAYE SAB KARBALA KE MAIDAN MAIN,<br>
 KAMAYI LOOT GAYI SAB APKI BIYAAN BAAME,<br>
SAKINA MARGAYI GHUT GHUT KE HAYE ZINDAAN MAIN,<br>
 MAIN QAID-E-SHAAM MAIN USKI LAHAD BANAYI HOON<br>
<br>
RASOOL ZADIYAAN PESHE YAZEED BE PARDA,<br>
 TAMAASH BEENO SE DARBAR THA SAJAYA HUA,<br>
SAR-E-HUSSAIN THA TASHT-E-TILA MAIN KHOON BHARA,<br>
 NA THI RIDA TOH MAIN BAALAON SE MOOH CHUPAYI HOON<br>
<br>
LARAZTE HOTHOU SE HO KIS TARHA BAYAAN AMMA,<br>
 YAZEED-E-SHAAM KE DARBAR KA SAMAA AMMA,<br>
 HAMARE BAZOO MAIN BAANDHE THE REESMA AMMA,<br>
 KIYA JO BHAIYI SE WADA WO MAIN NIBHAYI HOON<br>
<br>
SOHAIL NOUHA YE TERA ATAYE ZAINAB HAI,<br>
 KE TERI FIKR MAIN SHAMIL DUAYE ZAINAB HAI,<br>
 HAR EK LAFZ MAIN JAISE SADAYE ZAINAB HAI,<br>
 LAHAD PA KEHNA YE AMMA MAIN LUT KE AAYI HOON..